<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0.5in">The powers of the incorporator are to terminate
upon the filing of this Certificate of Incorporation with the Secretary of State of the State of Delaware. The names and mailing
addresses of the persons who are to serve as the directors of the Corporation until the first annual meeting of stockholders of the
Corporation, until their successors are duly elected and qualified, or until their earlier death, resignation, retirement, or
removal from office, are as follows:</P>

